<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>狐疝 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%8B%90%E7%96%9D/</link><description>Recent content in 狐疝 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 02 Jul 2026 15:33:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%8B%90%E7%96%9D/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>男治法：论狐疝 论强阳不倒 论痿阳不振</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-15-nanzhifa/</link><pubDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 10:16:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-15-nanzhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“男治法”部分，专论男子特有病症的辨治，包括&lt;strong&gt;狐疝、强阳不倒、痿阳不振&lt;/strong&gt;。核心思想是：男子之病多与肝肾相关，治当&lt;strong&gt;补泻兼施、水中补火&lt;/strong&gt;，使阴阳和调。</description></item><item><title>趺蹶手指臂肿转筋狐疝蚘虫病脉证治第十九</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-19/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 13:25:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-19/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;此篇论述了趺蹶、手指臂肿、转筋、狐疝、蛔虫五种病症的病因、脉象及治法，涵盖针刺、吐法、温经散寒、驱虫等治疗手段，体现了张仲景辨证施治的灵活思路。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>